  "description": "<div>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Welcome to Jislaine Natural Cosmetics</strong></span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\">&bull; Brand introduction: Pure Natural products, from their original origin.</p>\r\n<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: left;\"><br>&bull; Product description:<span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"> Our products are only made from the best, clean and pure raw materials, known and loved for many hundreds of years</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; USP (Unique Selling Point): Pure nature, Vegan, organical products.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">No add-ons like: Palm oil, animal ingredients, added fragrances, dyes, silicones, mineral oils, PEG derivatives, or any kind of chemical UV filters.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Payment terms:</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&nbsp;<br>&bull; Other information:</p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Welcome to Jislaine Natural Cosmetics</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">What we offer you:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Natural</strong>&nbsp;products that have been valued for their nourishing properties for generations in&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">different regions of the world</strong>&nbsp;.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">What we value:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">That the ingredients are as&nbsp;<strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">natural</strong> as possible.</span><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\"></strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 25px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bold;\">Why we do this:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; color: rgb(77, 75, 75); font-family: 'Century Gothic', sans-serif; font-size: 15px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Out of love for ourselves, our bodies and our environment. Not</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">only should our food be healthy and free of harmful additives, but also our care products, because they are absorbed through the skin and also enter our bodies. We should therefore complement a healthy diet with body care products that are free of harmful substances.</span>&nbsp;The environment is also happy about this, because harmful additives no longer enter the water cycle.</span></p>\r\n</div>",
